  "name": "Moving Wall",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>While you are within 5 feet of an allied creature and neither of you are Incapacitated, both of you have Half Cover.</p><p>When you move away from one or more allied creatures that are within 5 feet of you, they can use their Reaction to move up to their Speed to an unoccupied space within 5 feet of your new position.</p>",
